    <briefdescription>
<para>Application hooks of a device. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every member may be NULL.</para>
<para>Hooks run in the bus context with the bus lock held. They may call the lock-free device functions (<ref refid="group__x430_1gaea1c26465555bcd3d5b7fd49078d8440" kindref="member">x430_device_get()</ref>, <ref refid="group__x430_1gaf7a2c5ffac2a155fd4c7afe4aa0cee8c" kindref="member">x430_device_set()</ref>, <ref refid="group__x430_1ga723d7f0be186727e19a077e7f41718d8" kindref="member">x430_device_id()</ref>, <ref refid="group__x430_1ga2da15cacd4c4b35fa33c58a656e4263c" kindref="member">x430_device_raise_hardware_error()</ref>), but no bus function. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
